-- CoA characters use classes this addon has no stat weights for, so they fall back to the
-- generic "CUSTOM" weights. For a known CoA class, replace those generic builds with the
-- class's real specs so the advisor scores gear for Infinite/Time/Artificer (and so on)
-- instead of three identical "Custom Spec" entries.
--
-- Class/spec data copied from Kui_Nameplates\CoAClassSpecData.lua, which is generated by
-- coa-db/tools/gen_coa_class_spec_lua.py from coa-db/data/class_spec_meta.json. Keyed by the
-- in-game class token (2nd return of UnitClass). Weights use neutral stat names.

